SUMMARY:Tai Chi Basics
DESCRIPTION:🌿🧘‍♀️ Tai Chi Basics Course 🧘‍♂️🌿\nSaturday\, September 26 | 9–10am\nSlow down\, breathe deep\, and start your Saturday with some mindful movement at the vineyard! ☀️🍇\nJoin us for Tai Chi Basics\, a beginner-friendly introduction to this beautiful\, slow-moving martial art. Tai Chi focuses on balance\, leg strength\, coordination\, and fluid movement\, making it a wonderful way to get your body moving while calming the mind. ✨\nThis introductory class focuses on fundamental drills and postures that provide the foundation for deeper Tai Chi practice and its many benefits. Whether you’re completely new to Tai Chi or looking to strengthen your fundamentals\, you’re welcome to join us!\n🥋 Meet Your Instructor: Daniel Pfister\nDaniel has practiced Tai Chi for nearly 30 years\, including five years of intensive training while living in Taiwan. He later completed his master’s thesis researching the effects of Tai Chi stance training on blood pressure. 🇹🇼\nCome stretch\, move\, breathe\, and enjoy a peaceful morning surrounded by the vineyard. 🌱💚\n🎟️ Ticket Includes: Tai Chi Class\n📅 Saturday\, September 26\n⏰ 9–10am\n🍇 Great Bear Vineyards\nStart your weekend feeling refreshed\, balanced\, and ready for the day!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/tai-chi-basics-4/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Fitness,Outside
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/9-26-26-Tai-Chi-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
